{"entryId":"1236","paragraphs":[{"sourceId":"heilprin:sefaria-warsaw:ta:1236:1","sourceSha256":"beaa5184114a4cb8339fad19f224dcff248160f53597652f1b22c963b8395d9c","englishSha256":"755acec91cc7cbde0815001d9d322dd1b58ae87e14322368c4f1a641ed91f99e","citations":[{"id":"1236:1:citation-01","he":[16,28],"en":[20,34],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bava_Batra_19a.3"},"reference":"Bava Batra 19a:3","assessment":"The Bavli names Rav Chiyya son of Rav Avya in the discussion of the space between a fermenting vat and a wall.","evidence":[{"reference":"Bava Batra 19a:3","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bava_Batra_19a.3"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":"1236:1:citation-02","he":[29,43],"en":[36,48],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Menachot_43b.16"},"reference":"Menachot 43b:16","assessment":"The source names Rav Chiyya son of Rav Avya in the Sabbath and festival blessings report.","evidence":[{"reference":"Menachot 43b:16","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Menachot_43b.16"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":"1236:1:citation-03","he":[44,56],"en":[50,60],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Niddah_58a.11"},"reference":"Niddah 58a:11","assessment":"The witness names Rav Chiyya son of Rav Avya for an explicit version of the school of Yannai’s statement.","evidence":[{"reference":"Niddah 58a:11","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Niddah_58a.11"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":"1236:1:citation-04","he":[106,136],"en":[171,182],"target":{"url":"https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%99%D7%91%D7%9E%D7%95%D7%AA%20%D7%9C%D7%98%20%D7%91"},"reference":"Yevamot 39b, Wikisource","assessment":"In the cited passage Chiyya bar Avya supplements the halitzah document formula in Rav Yehudah’s name.","evidence":[{"reference":"Yevamot 39b, Wikisource","target":{"url":"https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%99%D7%91%D7%9E%D7%95%D7%AA%20%D7%9C%D7%98%20%D7%91"},"witness"